  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, the option to enable/disable the debug view is buried under 3 layers in the action menu, and the menu resets all the way back when you change avatars, so you need to go back into the whole menu each time if you want to turn on/off the debug info.\nI think beyond it's use as debug info, it's useful to see what can be interacted with on someone else's avatar, or on an avatar you didn't make. And it should be promoted to a button in the QM settings.",
